& [Admission] is one nonblocking process-local permit
  + permit is shared by every clone of one server instance
  + acquisition occurs after closed input validation and before any dependency rehash or child launch
  + failed acquisition returns runtime_busy as MCP isError true
  + runtime_busy contains no runtime or verification claim because no job starts

& [Lifetime] is complete tool execution
  + permit spans route child and any selected or negative evidence verification child
  + lexical RAII release covers every return path cancellation and unwinding

& [Nonclaims] are explicit
  + no queue fairness waiting retry priority distributed singleton or token-ring protocol
  + independently launched server processes do not share this permit

& [Acceptance] is measurable
  + [RASF-001] source and manifest verify
  + [RASF-002] two overlapping direct calls yield exactly one execution and one runtime_busy without a second child
  + [RASF-003] permit releases after success refusal timeout and verification failure
  + [RASF-004] official MCP sequential selected fault and recovery behavior remains exact
  + [RASF-005] EVO-X2 selected and refused routes plus noninterference pass after deployment

& [Signature] is bounded implementation authority
  + [signature_uuid] is bd5b3141-30ea-4b70-98f9-321db2511040
